msgid "Select 'Yes' to enable add debug output to log."
msgstr "Roghnaigh 'Tá' chun aschur dífhabhtaithe a chur leis chun logáil a chumasú."

msgid "Select 'Yes' to enable the addition of Weather."
msgstr "Roghnaigh 'Tá' chun an Aimsir a chur leis."

msgid "Select location"
msgstr "Roghnaigh suíomh"

msgid "Select the City and Press Ok"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an Chathair agus Brúigh OK"

msgid "Select the detail level in the detail view. You have the choice between a comprehensive presentation in a smaller font and a reduced presentation with a larger font."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an leibhéal mionsonraí san amharc mion. Tá rogha agat idir cur i láthair cuimsitheach i gcló níos lú agus cur i láthair laghdaithe le cló níos mó."

msgid "Select the metric unit for wind speed to be used for wind displays. This has no effect on the imperial unit 'mph'."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an t-aonad méadrach do luas na gaoithe le húsáid le haghaidh taispeántais gaoithe. Níl aon éifeacht aige seo ar an aonad impiriúil ‘mph’."

msgid "Select the preferred weather service to supply the weather information."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an tseirbhís aimsire is fearr leat chun an t-eolas aimsire a sholáthar."

msgid "Select the temperature unit to be used for temperature displays."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an t-aonad teochta atá le húsáid le haghaidh taispeántais teochta."

msgid "Select this option to save that last obtained weather data locally. This is used to initialize the data immediately after restart while updated data is being fetched."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an rogha seo chun na sonraí aimsire is déanaí a fuarthas go háitiúil a shábháil. Úsáidtear é seo chun na sonraí a thúsú díreach tar éis atosú agus sonraí nuashonraithe á bhfáil."

